      <!-- ===================================================================== -->
      <!-- LAMPIRAN: LEMBAR KERJA PESERTA DIDIK (LKPD)                           -->
      <!-- ===================================================================== -->
      <div class="page-break-before" style="margin-top: 32px; border-top: 2px dashed #9CA3AF; padding-top: 20px;">

        <!-- KOP LKPD -->
        <div style="text-align: center; border: 2px solid #000000; background-color: #F3F4F6; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <div style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
            LEMBAR KERJA PESERTA DIDIK (LKPD)
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 2px;">
            UNIT: GREAT ATHLETES (DESCRIPTIVE TEXT)
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 9.5pt; margin-top: 2px;">
            Mata Pelajaran: Bahasa Inggris • Kelas X (Fase E) • SMAN 3 Jeneponto
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- IDENTITAS SISWA / KELOMPOK -->
        <table class="doc-table">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="width: 22%; font-weight: bold;">Nama Kelompok</td>
            <td style="width: 33%;">....................................................</td>
            <td style="width: 18%; font-weight: bold;">Kelas / Tanggal</td>
            <td style="width: 27%;">X - ...... / ................... 2026</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Anggota Kelompok</td>
            <td colspan="3">
              1. .................................................... &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. ....................................................<br>
              2. .................................................... &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. ....................................................
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody></table>

        <!-- PETUNJUK BELAJAR -->
        <div style="border: 1px solid #000000; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; background-color: #FAFAFA; font-size: 10.5pt;">
          <strong>Petunjuk Belajar (Learning Instructions):</strong>
          <ol class="doc-list" style="margin-top: 3px;">
            <li>Berdoalah dan pusatkan perhatian sebelum memulai aktivitas (<em>Mindful Learning</em>).</li>
            <li>Bacalah teks model secara saksama dan diskusikan setiap pertanyaan bersama anggota kelompokmu.</li>
            <li>Gunakan <em>Vocabulary Word Bank</em> yang tersedia jika membutuhkan bantuan kosakata bahasa Inggris.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- ACTIVITY 1: MEMAHAMI (READING & TEXT DECONSTRUCTION) -->
        <table class="doc-table">
          <tbody><tr class="doc-header-row">
            <td colspan="2">ACTIVITY 1: UNDERSTANDING (MEMAHAMI TEKS &amp; KOSAKATA)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="2">
              <strong>A. Read the descriptive text below carefully!</strong>
              <div class="text-model-box" style="margin-top: 6px;">
                <strong>Veddriq Leonardo: The Pride of Indonesian Speed Climbing</strong><br><br>
                Veddriq Leonardo is one of Indonesia’s greatest athletes in sport climbing. Born in Pontianak, West Kalimantan, he gained international recognition after winning a historic gold medal at the 2024 Paris Olympics.<br><br>
                Veddriq has an athletic, lean, and muscular build, which helps him move swiftly up the climbing wall. Beyond his physical strength, he is known as a humble, disciplined, and calm person. Even under immense pressure during final matches, he stays focused and never gives up easily. Every day, he trains rigorously to improve his speed and agility. His dedication and sportsmanship truly inspire young Indonesians to dream big and work hard.
              </div>

              <strong>B. Answer the following comprehension questions based on the text!</strong>
              <ol class="doc-list" style="margin-top: 4px;">
                <li>What is the main purpose (social function) of the text above?<br>
                  <em>Answer:</em> ................................................................................................................................................</li>
                <li>Which paragraph functions as the <strong>Identification</strong>? Write the key information introduced there!<br>
                  <em>Answer:</em> ................................................................................................................................................</li>
                <li>How does the writer describe Veddriq’s character when facing pressure in final matches?<br>
                  <em>Answer:</em> ................................................................................................................................................</li>
                <li>Find 4 verbs in <em>Simple Present Tense</em> used in paragraph 2 (e.g., <em>has</em>):<br>
                  <em>Answer:</em> (1) ...................... &nbsp; (2) ...................... &nbsp; (3) ...................... &nbsp; (4) ......................</li>
              </ol>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="sub-header-row">
            <td colspan="2">C. Vocabulary Sorting: Classify the adjectives below into the correct column!</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="2" style="background-color: #F8FAFC; font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt;">
              Word List: <strong>muscular • humble • agile • disciplined • tall • resilient • calm • athletic • determined • energetic</strong>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; background-color: #F3F4F6;">Physical Appearance (Ciri Fisik)</td>
            <td style="width: 50%; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; background-color: #F3F4F6;">Personality Traits (Sifat Kepribadian)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="height: 68px;">
              1. .................................... &nbsp;&nbsp; 4. ....................................<br>
              2. .................................... &nbsp;&nbsp; 5. ....................................<br>
              3. ....................................
            </td>
            <td style="height: 68px;">
              1. .................................... &nbsp;&nbsp; 4. ....................................<br>
              2. .................................... &nbsp;&nbsp; 5. ....................................<br>
              3. ....................................
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody></table>

        <!-- ACTIVITY 2: MENGAPLIKASI (WRITING & CREATING SPOTLIGHT CARD) -->
        <table class="doc-table">
          <tbody><tr class="doc-header-row">
            <td colspan="2">ACTIVITY 2: APPLYING (MENYUSUN PROFIL ATLET INSPIRATIF)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="2">
              <strong>Task: "Athlete Spotlight Card" (100–130 Words)</strong><br>
              Pilihlah satu atlet nasional, internasional, atau siswa berprestasi olahraga di sekolahmu. Susunlah draf deskripsi singkat pada kerangka di bawah ini sebelum memindahkannya ke kartu poster/Canva!
              <div style="background-color: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; padding: 6px 8px; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 9.5pt;">
                <strong>Scaffolding Word Bank:</strong> <em>badminton, football, volleyball, weightlifting, martial arts • slim, strong, fast, well-built • hard-working, polite, brave, inspiring, consistent • trains every day, wins medals, never gives up.</em>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 26%; font-weight: bold;">1. Identification<br><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 9.5pt;">(Nama, asal, &amp; cabang olahraga atlet)</span></td>
            <td style="height: 65px;">
              <em>Starter: <strong>........................................</strong> is one of my favorite athletes. He/She comes from <strong>................................</strong> and competes in <strong>........................................</strong>.</em><br><br>
              ........................................................................................................................................................................
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">2. Description<br><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 9.5pt;">(Ciri fisik, kepribadian, latihan, &amp; nilai inspiratif)</span></td>
            <td style="height: 125px;">
              <em>Starter: He/She has <strong>........................................</strong> (physical appearance). Besides that, he/she is a <strong>........................................</strong> (personality) person. Every day, he/she <strong>........................................</strong>. I admire him/her because <strong>........................................</strong>.</em><br><br>
              ........................................................................................................................................................................<br><br>
              ........................................................................................................................................................................
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody></table>

        <!-- ACTIVITY 3: MEREFLEKSI (PEER-ASSESSMENT & SELF-REFLECTION) -->
        <table class="doc-table">
          <tbody><tr class="doc-header-row">
            <td colspan="2">ACTIVITY 3: REFLECTING (GALLERY WALK &amp; REFLEKSI DIRI)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
              <strong>A. Peer-Assessment (Gallery Walk Checklist)</strong><br>
              <span style="font-size: 9.5pt;">Kunjungi 1 karya kelompok lain dan beri tanda centang (√):</span>
              <div style="margin-top: 5px; font-size: 10pt;">
                Nama Kelompok Dikunjungi: .................................<br>
                [ &nbsp; ] Memuat nama &amp; cabang olahraga (<em>Identification</em>)<br>
                [ &nbsp; ] Mendeskripsikan ciri fisik &amp; sifat (<em>Description</em>)<br>
                [ &nbsp; ] Menggunakan kata sifat &amp; <em>Simple Present</em> tepat<br>
                <em>Pesan Apresiasi:</em> ...................................................
              </div>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
              <strong>B. Mindful Self-Reflection (3-2-1)</strong><br>
              <ol class="doc-list" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 4px;">
                <li><strong>2 New Adjectives</strong> I learned today:<br>
                  ........................................................................</li>
                <li><strong>1 Challenge</strong> I faced in English &amp; how I solved it:<br>
                  ........................................................................</li>
                <li><strong>1 Athlete Value</strong> I will apply in my study:<br>
                  ........................................................................</li>
              </ol>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody></table>

      </div>
